sion, you should soften or reframe the most extreme wording (e.g., replace explicit destruction/disintegration language with abstract or metaphorical phrasing), tone down direct commands that imply harm or annihilation, and emphasize emotional or symbolic conflict over physical breakdown—this keeps the narrative intact but avoids triggering safeguards around violent or disturbing imagery generation." no as and such okay. Safe as possible.
